  m_Name: SocialHearMore01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hearMoreName: SocialHearMore01
  hearMoreText: "Accessibility and inclusion go beyond adding optional features \u2014
    they\u2019re core to sustainable design because they expand who can benefit from
    technology. When apps support multiple languages, screen readers, captions, or
    high-contrast modes, they reduce digital inequality and increase social participation.
    Inclusive software doesn\u2019t just help individuals; it strengthens entire
    communities by ensuring no one is excluded due to ability, background, or technology
    limitations."
